{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-09-08 00:01:00', 'title': 'IBM UNVEILS NEW GENERATION OF IBM POWER SERVERS FOR FRICTIONLESS, SCALABLE HYBRID CLOUD', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., SEPT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE NEW IBM POWER E1080 SERVER, THE FIRST IN A NEW FAMILY OF SERVERS BASED ON THE NEW IBM POWER10 PROCESSOR, DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR HYBRID CLOUD ENVIRONMENTS.'}